    "https://osu.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/job/Columbus-Campus/Event-Services-Associate-1_R158202-1": {
      "title": "Event Services Associate 1",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-09-04\nPosted: Posted Yesterday\nPart time\n\nScreen reader users may encounter difficulty with this site. For assistance with applying, please contact hr-accessibleapplication@osu.edu . If you have questions while submitting an application, please review these frequently asked questions . Current Employees and Students: If you are currently employed or enrolled as a student at The Ohio State University, please l og in to Workday to use the internal application process. Welcome to The Ohio State University's career site.  We invite you to apply to positions of interest. In order to ensure your application is complete, you must complete the following: Ensure you have all necessary documents available when starting the application process. You can review the additional job description section on postings for documents that may be required. Prior to submitting your application, please review and update (if necessary) the information in your candidate profile as it will transfer to your application.  Job Title: Event Services Associate 1 Department: Athletics | Ticket Office-JM Provides support to the Ticket Office on game day and in the office with day-to-day tasks. They are expected at all times to communicate effectively, provide a high standard of customer service, adhere to NCAA regulations, and uphold Ohio State University policy, regulations, and ethical standards. Provides customer service and answers questions regarding Ohio State Athletics events, concerts, and family shows via telephone, chat, and email. Students will utilize the Ticket Office database to assist customers, sell tickets at the ticket windows, assist in will-call management, ticket equipment distribution, and ticket issue trouble-shooting on event days. Shifts include regular Ticket Office hours as well as night and weekend shifts throughout the year. Additional Information: Location: Schottenstein Center (0081) Position Type: Intermittent Scheduled Hours: